# Prompty - API Keys Configuration
#
# DEV ONLY: Vite inlines VITE_* values into the built bundle. Do NOT use this
# file for keys in a production deployment — keys would leak to anyone who
# fetches the built JS. For everyday use, add keys through the in-app settings
# UI instead; those are kept in localStorage on the user's own machine.
#
# Providers: OpenAI (GPT-5.x), Anthropic (Claude 4.x), HuggingFace,
# Novita (Llama 3/4), OpenRouter (Gemini 3.x, etc.)

VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
VITE_HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=
VITE_NOVITA_API_KEY=
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY= 